godot/issues/comments/5465845864","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122984#issuecomment-5465845864","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122984","id":5465845864,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRcowaA","user":{"login":"GustJc","id":3084189,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODQxODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3084189?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc","html_url":"https://github.com/GustJc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-30T00:52:19Z","updated_at":"2026-08-30T00:53:40Z","body":"> I can't reproduce the issue on an M2 MBP with current master ([5ec4857](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/5ec4857b340b6284a18b49b2eda462bd250f219a))\n> \n> There was a PR for dev3 that touched on our norma mapping code [#121012](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121012). However, I am not sure how it could cause the behaviour you report, especially with SSAO impacting the behaviour.\n\nTurns out I was using an old empty project template that was using vulkan instead of d3d12.\n\nSo it seems **this regression only happens with vulkan** (tested on windows).\nChanging the RenderingDevice to d3d12 solves the artifacts.\n\nNot sure if vulkan is still supported since d3d12 is the new default. \nFeel free to close this issue if vulkan not supported anymore since the regression only happens there.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5465845864/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5466077410","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122984#issuecomment-5466077410","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122984","id":5466077410,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRc244g","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-30T01:47:45Z","updated_at":"2026-08-30T01:47:45Z","body":"Vulkan is definitely still supported, but that helps narrow things down. \n\nI tested on MacOS which uses Metal, so it makes sense I couldn't repro. \n\nCc @blueskythlikesclouds who primarily used Windows","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/i